      "positive": "Create Nori-7, small friendly gardening robot, rounded teardrop ceramic body, short stable legs, oversized readable eyes, mechanical sprout on crown, compact water tank backpack, retractable watering nozzle. Matte cream ceramic, leaf green joints, soft sky-glass eyes. Gentle household helper, not industrial machinery. Front, side, back, three-quarter turnaround; neutral and action poses; four state icons; material callouts; rear-view readability; 2-head proportion grid.",
